  "description": "[STUDIO CHOOM & CHILL] QUEEN's ERA 🧡SOMI / Hwa Sa / CHUNG HA / SUNMI / Moon Byul🧡\n[STUDIO CHOOM & CHILL] QUEEN's ERA 🧡전소미 / 화사 / 청하 / 선미 / 문별🧡\n\n📌2020 QUEEN's ERA📌\n2020년 스춤에서 심장 저격하고 간 '퀸' 퍼포 모음🔥\n짜릿한 퍼포부터 꿀잼 비하인드까지 같이 봐요! ✿˘◡˘✿\n\n00:00 [BE ORIGINAL] SOMI(전소미) ‘What You Waiting For’\n02:55 [BE ORIGINAL] SOMI(전소미) 'What You Waiting For' (Behind)\n08:36 [BE ORIGINAL] Hwa Sa(화사) ‘Maria(마리아)’\n11:58 [BE ORIGINAL] Hwa Sa(화사) ‘Maria(마리아)’ (Behind)\n16:53 [BE ORIGINAL] CHUNG HA(청하) 'Stay Tonight'\n20:33 [BE ORIGINAL] 청하(CHUNG HA) 'Stay Tonight' (Behind)\n24:50 [BE ORIGINAL] 선미(SUNMI) ‘pporappippam(보라빛 밤)’\n28:17 [BE ORIGINAL] 선미(SUNMI) ‘pporappippam(보라빛 밤)’ (Behind)\n36:26 [BE ORIGINAL] 문별(Moon Byul) '달이 태양을 가릴 때(Eclipse)'\n39:59 [BE ORIGINAL] 문별(Moon Byul) '달이 태양을 가릴 때(Eclipse)' (Behind)\n\n#SOMI #HwaSa #CHUNGHA #SUNMI #MoonByul\n\nWe wish for a joyful year-end holiday with STUDIO CHOOM & CHILL!\nAdieu 2020👋🏼 HAPPY NEW YEAR 2021👏🏼\n\nStream various performance video on STUDIO CHOOM!\n\n👉SUBSCRIBE👈\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/STUDIOCHOOM\nFacebook:  https://www.facebook.com/StudioCHOOM\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/studio_choom/\nNaver TV: https://tv.naver.com/cjenm.STUDIOCHOOM",
